# Deckent runtime artifacts (per-sprint, ephemeral)
# Cache-prefix stability: these files change frequently and alter git-status snapshot,
# breaking system-prompt cache coherence. Gitignored to preserve prompt-cache prefix
# identity across sprint runs (analysis: docs/analysis/2026-06-10-weekly-limit-reverse-engineering.md §8)
.deckent/heartbeat.pid
.deckent/sprint.lock
.deckent/mcp-server.pid
.deckent/*-gate.json

